/= submodule contains knowledge bases, per-agent tasks, and audit logs. Users should create their own personalization repo with their own knowledge and agent configurations. See =personalization/= for the default setup.\n\n** Build\n\n#+begin_src bash\ncd i.ar\n./containers/build.sh\n#+end_src\n\n** Run\n\nThere is one entry point: =iar.sh=. It has two modes -- interactive (default) and loop (=--loop=).\n\nBoth modes require =--personalization= pointing to a directory with =knowledge/=, =tasks/=, and =audit/= subdirectories.\n\n*** Interactive Sessions (default mode)\n\nDrops you into an Emacs gptel chat buffer with an agent loaded. You're the conductor -- you type, the agent responds, you direct the work.\n\n#+begin_src bash\n# Interactive session with self-modification (for development with darwin)\n./utils/iar.sh \\\n  --self-modification \\\n  --personalization ~/repos/iar-personalization \\\n  --gptel-fork ~/repos/gptel\n\n# Interactive session (no self-modification, load agents via C-c a inside Emacs)\n./utils/iar.sh \\\n  --personalization ~/repos/iar-personalization \\\n  --gptel-fork ~/repos/gptel\n#+end_src\n\n*** Autonomous Loops (=--loop=)\n\nRuns an agent for N cycles with cooldown between each. Sends Telegram notifications if =AGENT_TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN= and =AGENT_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID= are set. Container names are auto-suffixed with PID so multiple loops can run in parallel without collisions.\n\n#+begin_src bash\n# Darwin autonomous loop (code changes, self-modification enabled)\n./utils/iar.sh --loop \\\n  --self-modification \\\n  --personalization ~/repos/iar-personalization \\\n  --agent darwin \\\n  --gptel-fork ~/repos/gptel \\\n  --max-cycles 50\n\n# Gardener autonomous loop (prompt refinement, no self-modification)\n./utils/iar.sh --loop \\\n  --personalization ~/repos/iar-personalization \\\n  --agent gardener \\\n  --gptel-fork ~/repos/gptel \\\n  --max-cycles 10\n\n# Playground loop on GPU model (sophon, 120B, 128K context)\n./utils/iar.sh --loop \\\n  --personalization ~/repos/iar-personalization \\\n  --agent playground \\\n  --model nemotron-3-super:120b \\\n  --ctx 131072 \\...[+5168 chars]
